WEBVTT

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.550
<b></b>Menu 8 <b> A Letter to Join Feelings</b> 
 ~Arancini on the Green Hill~

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.690
It's such a nice day.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.830
C'mon, Misaki, just throw it in already.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:27.500
What about you, Suzuna? 
Why are you putting it off?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.100
What do you mean? LOL!

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:35.120
I'm not putting it off! 
I can throw it in anytime!

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:44.320
Okay, no more playing around! 
Other people are waiting!

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:45.550
Sorry about that.

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:47.290
All yours!

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:48.920
Thank you.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:01.770
Th-This was the right 
thing to do, wasn't it?

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:05.500
Well, I mean, we've done what we could.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:08.360
There's nothing else to... y'know.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:15.250
Hey, you!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.290
Hands in the air!

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.280
Meep!

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:19.920
Robbers?!

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.070
Not that!

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:32.980
Sorry for bargin' in!

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.960
Outta the way!

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:39.950
This is ultra super bad!

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:41.980
Those are our letters of recommendation!

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:43.780
And right after we finally got them!

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:46.360
Wh-Wh-Wh-What should we do?
 Chase them down?

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:50.330
Y-Yeah, we should! 
Our future depends on it!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.830
B-But how are we gonna...?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:53.830
Excuse me...

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.930
I would also like to recover an 
important letter from that sack.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:01.210
Would it be all right if I joined you?

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:11.630
I snuck some of my fairies 
into the robbers' loot.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.980
It appears they're still on the move.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.920
Wow, Kokie, you're smart!

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.130
Now we won't lose their trail!

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.980
Yes. Let's be sure to get 
those letters back.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.750
What did they steal from the two of you?

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.260
Oh, uh...

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.740
Letters of recommendation.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.600
We're students at a school 
called Lucent Academy...

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:44.760
But the school's about to be closed down.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.480
Oh, dear.

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.110
Why would that happen?

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:52.780
Because our grades are so terrible.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:54.020
Meep...

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:57.990
Apparently, our standard deviation 
scores are so disastrously low

00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:01.900
that Landosol decided a school 
like ours must be useless.

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:06.830
There's a teacher who's been helping 
us out and never left us behind,

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:10.050
but for some reason our grades 
just keep dropping...

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:13.040
Well, the sevens row is super hard!

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.420
It's like the final boss 
of the times table!

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:18.120
No way! The eights row is the real...

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:25.300
W-Well, anyway, if the two 
of us stay at Lucent,

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.810
we feel like it might really close down.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:31.060
So we finally got letters of recommendation

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.750
for other schools without 
our teacher knowing...

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:37.920
And then those robbers stole them! LOL!

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:40.250
I... I see.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:45.120
Meep!

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:46.030
Korokko!

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.980
This way might be a shortcut!

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.700
M-Meep...

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.360
For sure.

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:59.110
I dunno why, but that's pretty funny.

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:00.680
This must be the place.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:03.600
It definitely has that super bad look.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.430
How do we get inside?

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:08.670
Looks like it's my time to shine.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.640
Can't you tell?

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:14.180
They're pouring out from everywhere!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.810
Um... What are you talking about?

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:19.190
Pheromones, obviously!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:21.840
The undeniable, inescapable charms of a...

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:25.350
mature... adult... woman!

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:27.830
Uh-huh...

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:28.900
Here's the plan.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:33.580
You get the letters back while I 
distract them with my grown-up charm!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:53.840
<i>They're looking!</i>

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:58.020
<i>Grown-up charm like mine 
just can't be hidden!</i>

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.720
<i>Did I release a few too many pheromones?</i>

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:17.370
Hey, boss! We found this kid 
who's messed up in the head!

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:20.110
M-Meep!

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:27.120
All according to plan...

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.370
Your Majesty?

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.930
You've done it again, Metamorregnant.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.570
The level of depth is entirely different.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.490
Bad girl.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:50.330
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:53.320
I saw you from the terrace, and... well...

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.630
You'd best be careful.

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:59.150
Y-Yes, Your Majesty!

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.550
Did something happen?

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:30.970
Hi.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.720
I see.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:42.290
I used to have companions.

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:45.160
Why did I forget about them?

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:52.500
I know we went on lots of adventures, 
just like the Gourmet Guild...

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:58.700
I couldn't protect them.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:04.810
Yes... That may be.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.570
But you are alive.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.730
And, without a doubt, that means something.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.580
You have companions now, too, don't you?

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:33.890
I will...

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:37.520
keep them safe, no matter what.

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:43.880
Yes.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:06.140
They'll disappear.

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:17.440
I'm sure once I tell them I'm 
really Princess Eustiana,

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:23.500
Karyl and Yuuki and everyone 
else will leave me.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:27.460
I'll be erased from their minds.

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:30.600
They'll forget my very existence.

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:34.660
Everyone I've met will...

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:40.560
I'm sick of being forgotten 
and ending up alone!

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:42.430
I hate it!

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:58.680
Why don't these guys see my grown-up charm?

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:00.700
Are they stupid?!

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.320
LOL!

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:07.480
Look at you, about to cry in here!

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:09.860
H-How did you get here?!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.870
We used a bit of smoke.

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:19.820
Lady Ameth, grant me strength!

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:22.380
Dang, Kokie, you're super smart!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.070
Thanks.

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.240
I found them!

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:31.950
Let's get out while we can.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:38.400
Shit! How does that much smoke 
come from a dried-up gecko?!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.870
We did nab that weird kid earlier.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:42.570
Maybe her buddies did it!

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:46.060
Oh, crap! The treasure in 
the storehouse is gone!

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:48.140
They can't have gotten too far away yet!

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:50.080
All right, boys! Get 'em!

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:58.120
What do we do?

00:12:58.120 --> 00:12:59.840
Let's wait them out over there.

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:09.450
Miss Io is going to be so worried.

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:13.220
What are we even doing?

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.720
The person you mentioned earlier...

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.230
Is that...?

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:18.770
Yeah.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:23.440
Io Miss has always had our backs,

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.870
even though our grades are so low.

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:29.110
All the other teachers gave up on us,

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.870
but she told us, 
"Let's do our best together."

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:37.470
She really believed in us.

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:44.430
We don't want to cause any more trouble 
for Miss Io after all she did for us,

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:46.630
so we decided to transfer 
to another school.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.630
There they are!

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:52.150
They found us!

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:53.460
This is super bad!

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:01.960
Hold up, damn it!

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:16.320
Okay, now I'm mad!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:22.790
Have some of this!

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.150
Did I get them?

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:37.810
You did it! That was awesome!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:42.610
Damn you punks! 
Now you've gone and done it!

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:46.660
We're done for!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.710
Girls! This way!

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:00.680
Miss Io?!

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:02.090
Io Miss?!

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:07.530
You ruffians dare to disturb 
the peace in this town?

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:10.160
Take some time to reflect 
on your actions in jail!

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.830
I followed the big cloud of smoke here.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:20.760
A post office worker told me you'd 
had a struggle with some robbers.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:22.230
What a shock that was.

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:28.670
Th-Thank you for coming to find us.

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:40.500
You're my students. That much is a given!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.760
Hey! Io Miss!

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:54.290
You're embarrassing us! Stop!

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:28.680
Your letter of recommendation!

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:33.800
I'm going to give it one more try.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:40.270
We have to do our best for 
Io Miss, since she believed in us!

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:47.510
Yeah! First on the list is 
mastering those sevens!

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:59.120
Seven times one is one! 
Seven times two is two!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:16.410
You're working hard.

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:21.140
Sorry I'm late.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:37.820
Oh, man! Still a lot of rice 
left to harvest, huh?

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.960
C'mon, let's all knock this out together!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.780
Yeah!

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:56.280
What're you so cheery for?

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:01.050
I guess you're always cheery, actually.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.590
That said...

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:06.860
It'll take us forever to 
get through all this.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.220
Let's be patient and stick to it!

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:12.570
Miss Pecorine!

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:15.060
Hey!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.500
Rimama!

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:21.290
We're here to help you out!

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:29.080
Wow! This field's super huge!

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:32.790
But how...?

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:43.710
I thought it would be nice if we all 
harvested the princess rice together.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.590
I got a letter from Kokkoro.

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:50.840
I got one, too.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:56.690
Nice!

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:04.120
Sour!

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:04.960
Sour!

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:06.430
Rimama!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.170
Kokkoro.

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:44.120
After I lost everything,

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:50.190
I never thought I'd be able to eat a 
meal with everyone like this again.

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:02.170
Thank you.

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.390
I'm truly happy.

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:17.560
I never knew...

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:26.140
I never knew a flavor this happy existed...

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.440
Yes, it's truly delicious.

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.400
I'm...

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:59.230
I'm going to tell Karyl and Yuuki

00:22:00.650 --> 00:22:02.780
that I'm Eustiana.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.970
Menu 9 <b>  Converging Hearts, Passing Souls 
~Crepes the Flavor of a Promise~</b>
